<title>UK: Cyprus to make Eurobond debut with five-yr dollars.</title>
<headline>Cyprus to make Eurobond debut with five-yr dollars.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus is to launch a five-year dollar deal which will be its debut Eurobond offering, bankers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It was expected the deal will be issued under a soon-to-be-established Euro medium-term note programme.</p>
<p>A delegation comprising officials from the Central Bank of Cyprus and its ministry of finance was expected to make a presentation to investors in London on Wednesday, May 18, bankers said.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
